  (text "CRSF-Router 8 Variante 2 (THT): 1 Uplink + 7 Ports, je Port GND / +V / TX / RX" (at 12.70 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0ac315e9-77a9-4d60-9062-55e72adc2995))
  (text "Steckerleiste J1-J8 (2,54 mm, gerade): Pin 1 GND, 2 +V, 3 Router-TX -> RX Geraet, 4 Router-RX <- TX Geraet" (at 12.70 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f1ce9b0-da5a-4424-9f0f-ae748a1b2de0))
  (text "VBUS = BEC 5-6 V (kein HV-BEC!). Uplink direkt, alle Ports gemeinsam ueber F1. Modul mit eigener Versorgung: V-Ader nicht stecken." (at 12.70 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bf741fae-e448-4d76-a98b-f6154727fc59))
  (text "Kein Spannungsregler: RP2350-Zero bekommt BEC ueber D1 (ca. 0,3 V Verlust) am 5V-Pin. D1 verhindert Rueckstrom bei USB." (at 152.40 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b14d1aa1-91f1-46c2-97b0-dc7d3e88bde8))
  (text "R1/R2/C4: VBUS/4,3 an GP26 (bis ca. 14 V messbar). Firmware v0.3.0 erwartet genau diesen Teiler." (at 152.40 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b2f04574-36e3-4c59-a444-05edaac7c1d0))
  (text "Variante 2: alle Bauteile THT, keine Serienwiderstaende, eine gemeinsame PTC-Sicherung statt einer je Port." (at 101.60 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7533c98f-6d70-4d65-8f57-fa253b34660a))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
